ng</div><div class='feature-desc'>AI-powered writing with mood detection and auto-formatting.</div></div><div class='feature'><div class='feature-icon'>🧠</div><div class='feature-title'>AI Coach</div><div class='feature-desc'>Personalized insights based on your habits and goals.</div></div><div class='feature'><div class='feature-icon'>💰</div><div class='feature-title'>Finance Tracker</div><div class='feature-desc'>Budgets, recurring transactions, and goal tracking.</div></div><div class='feature'><div class='feature-icon'>📡</div><div class='feature-title'>Offline First</div><div class='feature-desc'>Works perfectly without internet. Syncs when you reconnect.</div></div></div><div class='footer'><p>© 2025 Mwijay Note — Built with ❤️ in Nairobi</p><p style='color:#1e293b'>You received this because you signed up at mwijay.app.</p></div></div></body></html>",
